post.description:
Generate geometry for a standard model and return triangulated mesh data.
Request: { model_id: str, category: str, params: { Lpp, B, T, Cb } }
Response: { vertices: [...], indices: [...], name: str, category: str }

船体与附体的网格布尔运算 (并集/差集), 返回 Three.js 网格数组.

Request: {
  model_id: str,                          # 船型名称 (如 KCS), 用于截面公式
  params: { L, B, T, Cb },                # 主尺度
  appendages: [                           # 附体列表
    { type: "bulbous"|"transom"|"bilge_keel"|"skeg",
      operation: "union"|"difference",    # 默认 union
      ...尺寸/位置参数 (可选, 有默认比例) }
  ]
}
Response: { vertices, indices, vertex_count, triangle_count,
            watertight, method, appendages_applied }

get.description:
沿船体 NURBS 曲面法向偏移 t 米 (正=朝外, 负=朝内), 返回偏移后三角网格.

Response: { model_id, params, offset, vertices, indices,
            vertex_count, triangle_count }

post.description:
用一组平面对船体网格做 CSG 切割 (自实现, 不依赖 manifold3d), 返回闭合网格.

Request: {
  model_id: "KCS",
  params: { L, B, T, Cb },            # 可选, 缺省从标模库按 model_id 查
  cuts: [                              # 按顺序逐平面切割, 每步保持水密
    { normal: [0,0,1], origin: [0,0,-2], keep: "below" },   # 削顶 (保留 d<0 侧)
    { normal: [1,0,0], origin: [80,0,0], keep: "above" }    # 挖槽/取中段
  ]
}
Response: { vertices, indices, vertex_count, triangle_count,
            watertight, volume_before, volume_after, cuts, method }

get.description:
逐吃水 (0.1T → T, 均匀 n_drafts 点) 生成静水力曲线族.

Response: {
    curves: { drafts, displacement, Cb, Awp, LCB, VCB, TPC, MTC, wet_surface },
    meta:   { L, B, T, Cb }
}
- displacement: 排水量 (t, 海水密度 1.025)
- Awp: 水线面积 (m²)
- LCB: 浮心纵向位置, 距艉垂线 AP 向前为正 (m)
- VCB: 浮心垂向位置, 距基线向上 (m)
- TPC: 每厘米吃水吨数 (t/cm); MTC: 每厘米纵倾力矩 (t·m/cm, 简化)

post.description:
从 CAD 文件 (STEP 曲线集 / IGES 曲面) 提取归一化型值表.

Request: {
  format: 'step' | 'iges',
  file_path: '服务器本地文件路径' (测试用),
  content: '内联文件内容' (与 file_path 二选一, 提供时写入临时文件),
  ship_name: 'KCS' (IGES 查吃水 T 用),
  n_stations: 21, n_waterlines: 11
}
Response: { name, n_stations, n_waterlines, source, table: [[半宽归一化], ...] }

get.description:
对比两艘标模船: 设计吃水静水力 (排水量/Awp/LCB/VCB/湿表面) + 21 站半宽/面积型线.

返回结构见 api/compare_ships.py 的 compare_two_ships:
{a, b, hydro:{a, b, ratios}, stations:{xi, a_half_breadth, b_half_breadth, a_area, b_area}, summary}
